---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Services" description="TikTok Shop USA setup, creator onboarding and U.S. business registration for international sellers.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container reveal"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Services</div><span class="section-kicker">Services</span><h1>Your Gateway to TikTok Shop USA</h1><p class="lead">We coordinate the core U.S. setup requirements for international creators and brands — from company formation to platform approval.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/#calendly-section">Book a call</a></div></div></section>
<section><div class="container"><div class="grid-3">
<article class="card reveal"><div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><rect x="4" y="3" width="16" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M8 7h2M14 7h2M8 11h2M14 11h2M8 15h2M14 15h2M10 21v-3h4v3"/></svg></div><h3>TikTok Shop USA Setup</h3><p class="muted">We handle everything — LLC, EIN, U.S. rep, banking — so you can legally sell on TikTok Shop USA, even as a non-resident.</p></article>
<article class="card reveal"><div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M12 8a4 4 0 100 8 4 4 0 000-8z"/><path d="M4.9 4.9l2.2 2.2M16.9 16.9l2.2 2.2M4 12H1M23 12h-3M12 4V1M12 23v-3M4.9 19.1l2.2-2.2M16.9 7.1l2.2-2.2"/></svg></div><h3>Creator Onboarding & Monetization</h3><p class="muted">If you're a content creator, we help you open your own TikTok Shop USA to start earning from affiliate commissions or product sales.</p></article>
<article class="card reveal"><div class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-3 7.7-7 10-4-2.3-7-5.5-7-10V6l7-3z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></div><h3>U.S. Business Registration</h3><p class="muted">We'll register your LLC, get your EIN, and assign a U.S. representative to make sure your business is fully compliant for TikTok Shop.</p></article>
</div></div></section>
<section class="surface-alt"><div class="container"><div class="section-head reveal"><div><span class="section-kicker">Process</span><h2>Our Seamless Process to Launch Your TikTok Shop USA</h2><p class="lead">Whether you're a brand or a creator, we take care of the U.S. requirements so you can focus on growth.</p></div></div><div class="process">
<div class="card reveal"><span class="step-num">01</span><h3>U.S. LLC Formation</h3><p class="muted">We create your U.S. company in days.</p></div>
<div class="card reveal"><span class="step-num">02</span><h3>EIN & Banking</h3><p class="muted">We get your EIN and assist with your bank setup.</p></div>
<div class="card reveal"><span class="step-num">03</span><h3>U.S. Representative</h3><p class="muted">We provide a compliant U.S. business rep.</p></div>
<div class="card reveal"><span class="step-num">04</span><h3>TikTok Shop Approval</h3><p class="muted">We handle submission and approval support.</p></div></div><div class="actions reveal"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">Start your setup</a></div></div></section>
<section class="eu-close"><div class="container split"><div class="reveal"><span class="section-kicker">Western Europe</span><h2>A cross-border workflow that respects your existing market.</h2></div><div class="reveal"><p class="lead">For EU and UK founders, we use GDPR-conscious communication, clear documentation and time-zone-friendly coordination. Your U.S. setup is treated as an expansion layer — not a replacement for your existing VAT, tax or privacy obligations.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">Talk through your requirements</a></div></div></section>

</Layout>
